  "properties": {
    "title": "Gleo Feature Frenzy",
    "description": "Gleo is a nascent javascript WebGL mapping library. It aims to find a niche alongside Leaflet, OpenLayers, MapLibre and Deck.gl.\r\n\r\nThis library was presented at FOSS4G 2022. The \"feature frenzy\" highlights all of the features developed during the last year with live examples, including its extensible OOP paradigm, (re)projection support, symbols for XYM geometries, clustering, colour spaces, and vector field handling.",
